---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — Biggan.me"
  description="Terms and conditions governing the use of Biggan.me computational STEM tools, content licensing, and academic disclaimers."
  lang="en"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8">
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-mono">
        Terms & Conditions
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        By accessing or using Biggan.me, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base space-y-6 leading-relaxed bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">1. Permitted Educational Use</h2>
      <p>
        Biggan.me provides free digital STEM calculation utilities, worked derivations, and hardware keystroke guides. You are granted a personal, non-exclusive license to use these resources for personal study, homework verification, and non-commercial classroom instruction.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-6">2. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        The underlying procedural engines, interactive visual components, bilingual translations, and hardware keystroke tutorials are the intellectual property of Biggan.me. Automated scraping, unauthorized mirroring, and repackaging behind paywalls are strictly prohibited.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-6">3. Academic Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        While all models are rigorously validated against standardized curricula and peer-reviewed constants, Biggan.me provides these utilities "as-is" without warranty of any kind. Users are advised to cross-check computational outputs against their official examination board guidelines.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
